Linux Embedded Automotive Platform

A C++ Linux embedded automotive platform simulating
multiple ECUs communicating over a CAN bus.

Status
------
Early development.

Current milestone
-----------------
V0.2 - CAN communication and Engine ECU integration

Technologies
------------
- C++17
- Linux
- CMake
- Doxygen
- GDB
- SocketCAN
- systemd
- Yocto Project (planned)

## Project Status

### V0.1 — Initial ECU Simulation

- [x] Project structure
- [x] Engine ECU
- [x] Engine simulation

### V0.2 — CAN Communication

- [x] SocketCAN integration
- [x] Virtual CAN interface (`vcan0`)
- [x] CAN socket abstraction
- [x] C++ CAN frame transmission
- [x] Engine ECU CAN integration

### V0.3 — Multi-ECU Platform

- [ ] Multiple ECUs
- [ ] Gateway
- [ ] Unit tests